reports/signal_lab/prints_m60: the primary print-feature tables of signal lab 2 (prospective_prereg.md, deviation 4)
under the names the pipeline reads. f6_main.parquet and f6_early.parquet are byte copies (cmp) of
reports/signal_lab/prints/f6_main_m60.parquet and f6_early_m60.parquet (branch signal-lab-data, commit 440314f).
SHA256 in this folder holds the sha256sum of the two copies and their two sources (check from the repository root
with sha256sum -c reports/signal_lab/prints_m60/SHA256).

